      breach: { headline: "EDPB 72-hour breach notification standard applied strictly to health data incidents", excerpt: "The EDPB's enforcement review of 2025 breach notifications found systematic failures by healthcare organizations to notify within 72 hours, with average notification times of 8.4 days. The EDPB has signaled that 2026 enforcement will include fines for late notification even where no harm results. The French CNIL issued four fines to healthcare providers in Q1 2026 solely for notification timing failures.", action: "Implement an automated GDPR breach assessment workflow with 48-hour internal escalation triggers. Healthcare organizations must notify within 72 hours even with incomplete information — delay is independently enforceable." },
