      biometric: { headline: "Global biometric health data compliance requires three distinct frameworks for US, EU, and APAC operations", excerpt: "Illinois BIPA (US), GDPR Article 9 biometric provisions (EU), and Singapore PDPC biometric guidance create three distinct compliance frameworks for clinical biometric identification systems. A health system operating in all three jurisdictions cannot satisfy all three with a single policy. BIPA's per-violation exposure, GDPR's percentage-of-revenue fines, and Singapore's MAS guidance each require separate implementation.", action: "Implement jurisdiction-specific biometric compliance modules for US (BIPA), EU (GDPR Article 9), and APAC (Singapore PDPC) clinical biometric systems. Separate written policies, consent flows, and retention schedules are required for each jurisdiction." },
