      cross_border: { headline: "EU-UK adequacy renewal creates new advice obligation for cross-border legal service practices", excerpt: "The EU-UK adequacy decision renewal until December 2031, announced December 2025, stabilizes cross-border data flows for UK-EU law firm partnerships but introduces a mid-term review after four years. UK-EU law firms must update privacy policies to reflect the renewed adequacy, document the transfer mechanism in processing records, and monitor the mid-term review for potential disruption.", action: "Update all client cross-border transfer documentation to reflect the December 2025 EU-UK adequacy renewal. Note the mid-term review timeline in contingency planning documents — activate SCC fallback preparation if review signals adequacy withdrawal." },
